Instructions for Compileing and Running:

1. UNzip the archive
2. Navagate to the top-level directory
3. Inside the linux terminal go to the directory holding 'makefile' and run type 'make'
4. Run the  simulator using ./mipssim -i INPUTFILENAME -o OUTPUTFILENAME